# Creating DM with user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-testid='nav-chat']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='create-new-dm']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='user-search-input']" to appear
* typing stored user <userAlias> field "email" in "[data-testid='user-search-input']"
* clicking on stored user <userAlias> field "name" in "[data-testid='user-search-results']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='message-input']" to appear

# Creating group DM with users <userAlias1> and <userAlias2>
* clicking on "[data-testid='nav-chat']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='create-new-dm']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='user-search-input']" to appear
* typing stored user <userAlias1> field "email" in "[data-testid='user-search-input']"
* clicking on stored user <userAlias1> field "name" in "[data-testid='user-search-results']"
* typing stored user <userAlias2> field "email" in "[data-testid='user-search-input']"
* clicking on stored user <userAlias2> field "name" in "[data-testid='user-search-results']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='message-input']" to appear

# Opening group DM with users <userAlias1> and <userAlias2>
* Creating group DM with users <userAlias1> and <userAlias2>

# Sending stored message <messageAlias> in dm <dmAlias> for user <userAlias>
* typing stored user <userAlias> dm <dmAlias> message <messageAlias> in "[data-testid='message-input']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='send-message-button']" to be enabled
* clicking on "[data-testid='send-message-button']"
* waiting for stored user <userAlias> dm <dmAlias> message <messageAlias> to appear in "[data-testid='virtuoso-item-list']"

# Verifying stored message <messageAlias> in dm <dmAlias> for user <userAlias> is visible in current conversation
* waiting for network to be idle fast
* waiting for "[data-testid='chat-list-loading']" to disappear fast
* waiting for "[data-testid='virtuoso-item-list']" to appear fast
* waiting for zero sync to settle fast
* verifying stored user <userAlias> dm <dmAlias> message <messageAlias> is visible in "[data-testid='virtuoso-item-list']"

# Sending stored message <messageAlias> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* typing stored user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias> message <messageAlias> in "[data-testid='message-input']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='send-message-button']" to be enabled
* clicking on "[data-testid='send-message-button']"
* waiting for stored user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias> message <messageAlias> to appear in "[data-testid='virtuoso-item-list']"

